...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

ui: Streamlit 화면 { class: ours }
seq: 순서 함수 { class: ours }
market: 시장 분석 { class: ours }
agno_api: agno 통계 API { class: ext }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }

seq -> ui: update_callback(0.5, Analyzing market)
seq -> market: run(시장 분석 프롬프트)
market -> gemini: generateContent
gemini -> market: 분석 글
market -> agno_api: 실행 통계 (AGNO_TELEMETRY=false면 안 감)
market -> seq: RunOutput.content
seq -> ui: update_callback(0.7, Market analysis complete)
